<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ko" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>해결 기록 · DebugMate</title><link rel="stylesheet" th:href="@{/css/app.css(v='20261029-3')}"><script defer th:src="@{/js/app.js(v='20261029-3')}"></script></head><body><header th:replace="~{fragments/layout :: header('history')}"></header><main id="main-content" class="container page-shell"><div class="page-heading inline-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ERROR HISTORY</p><h1>해결 기록</h1><p>과거 문제와 해결 상태를 검색하고 다시 확인할 수 있습니다.</p></div><a class="button primary" th:href="@{/errors/new}">새 오류 등록</a></div>
<form class="search-bar" method="get" th:action="@{/errors}"><label class="sr-only" for="query">기록 검색</label><input id="query" name="query" th:value="${query}" placeholder="오류 제목 검색"><button class="button secondary" type="submit">검색</button></form>
<div class="empty-state" th:if="${#lists.isEmpty(cases)}"><strong>조건에 맞는 기록이 없습니다.</strong><p>검색어를 바꾸거나 새로운 오류를 등록해 주세요.</p></div><div class="case-list" th:unless="${#lists.isEmpty(cases)}"><a class="case-row large" th:each="item : ${cases}" th:href="@{/errors/{id}(id=${item.id})}"><div><strong th:text="${item.title}">오류 제목</strong><span th:text="${item.language + (#strings.isEmpty(item.framework) ? '' : ' · ' + item.framework)}">Java</span><time th:text="${#temporals.format(item.createdAt, 'yyyy.MM.dd HH:mm')}">날짜</time></div><span class="status" th:classappend="${' status-' + item.status.name().toLowerCase()}" th:text="${item.status.label}">상태</span></a></div></main><footer th:replace="~{fragments/layout :: footer}"></footer></body></html>
